msgid "https://codotx.com"
msgstr "https://codotx.com"

#. Description of the plugin
#: wp-resend-newsletter.php
msgid "In-site subscriber list, campaigns, and queued email sending via Resend API (resend/resend-php). Batch ≤50 recipients/request. Confirm/unsubscribe + bounce/complaint webhooks. MVP: no drag-drop designer, no global wp_mail replacement."
msgstr "站內訂閱者名單、電子報活動，並透過 Resend API（resend/resend-php）排程寄送郵件。每次請求批次 ≤50 位收件者。支援確認／取消訂閱與退信／投訴 webhook。MVP：無拖放設計器，不取代全站 wp_mail。"

#. Author of the plugin
#: wp-resend-newsletter.php
msgid "Oberon Lai"
msgstr "Oberon Lai"

